cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fastMethyl in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "fastMethyl: Fast, Parallel Preprocessing of Illumina Methylation Arrays"
abstract: >-
  A performance layer over minfi and bigmelon for large Illumina methylation
  cohorts. Provides parallel IDAT reading with an integer-indexed worker
  assembly hot path, and a fused per-sample streaming pipeline that runs read +
  detection p-value + raw preprocessing + sample/probe quality control in a
  single pass, writing an LZ4_RA-compressed, bigmelon-compatible GDS file
  without ever assembling a full cohort-sized matrix in RAM.
type: software
